    div = [
        div = "No revoking after settlement" meta {
            html::attributes = {
                id = "1.6-no-revoking-after-settlement"
                class = "clause-heading"
                data-number = "1.6"
            }
        }
        div = [
            div = [
                div = [
                    span = "UG2025" meta {
                        html::attributes = {
                            class = "doc-comment-id"
                        }
                    }
                    span = "RK" meta {
                        html::attributes = {
                            class = "doc-comment-initials"
                        }
                    }
                ] meta {
                    html::attributes = {
                        class = "doc-comment-meta"
                    }
                }
                div = [
                    "Replaced: 'section 156R of the Banking (Prudential Supervision) Act 1989.'"
                    "With: 'section 55 of the Financial Markets Infrastructure Act 2021.'"
                ] meta {
                    html::attributes = {
                        class = "doc-comment-content"
                    }
                }
            ] meta {
                html::attributes = {
                    class = "doc-comment"
                    data-change-id = "UG2025"
                }
            }
            "As HVCS payments are made through the Reserve Bank's designated settlement system, ESAS, they cannot\n\t\tbe reversed, repaid, recovered, or set aside under the terms of the Exchange Settlement Account terms\n\t\tand conditions and section 55 of the Financial Markets Infrastructure Act 2021."
        ] meta {
            html::attributes = {
                class = "level1"
            }
        }
    ] meta {
        html::attributes = {
            class = "clause-row"
        }
    }
    div = "" meta {
        html::attributes = {
            class = "tag-standards"
        }
    }
    div = [
        div = "Return HVCS payment: timing, format and content" meta {
            html::attributes = {
                id = "1.7-return-hvcs-payment-timing-format-and-content"
                class = "clause-heading"
                data-number = "1.7"
            }
        }
        ol = [
            "To comply with rule 9.21 and clause 2.2 of these HVCS Common Procedures , an instructed agent must\n\t\treturn an HVCS payment:"
            ol = [
                "as soon as practicable after making the decision to return it, and"
                div = [
                    div = [
                        span = "UG2025" meta {
                            html::attributes = {
                                class = "doc-comment-id"
                            }
                        }
                        span = "RK" meta {
                            html::attributes = {
                                class = "doc-comment-initials"
                            }
                        }
                    ] meta {
                        html::attributes = {
                            class = "doc-comment-meta"
                        }
                    }
                    div = [
                        "Revised from Part F - Co-existence Procedures to Part D, plus MX Message Specifications."
                    ] meta {
                        html::attributes = {
                            class = "doc-comment-content"
                        }
                    }
                ] meta {
                    html::attributes = {
                        class = "doc-comment"
                        data-change-id = "UG2025"
                    }
                }
                "in accordance with Part D - MX Procedures and the MX Message Specifications."
            ] meta {
                html::attributes = {
                    class = "level2 level2-counter-reset"
                }
            }
        ] meta {
            html::attributes = {
                class = "level1 level1-counter-reset"
            }
        }
    ] meta {
        html::attributes = {
            class = "clause-row"
        }
    }
    h1 = "Chapter 2: Errors" meta {
        html::attributes = {
            id = "chapter-2-errors"
            class = "section-heading"
        }
    }
    div = "" meta {
        html::attributes = {
            class = "tag-commentary"
        }
    }
    div = [
        div = "Errors" meta {
            html::attributes = {
                id = "2.1-errors"
                class = "clause-heading"
                data-number = "2.1"
            }
        }
        div = [
            "Sometimes an instructed agent cannot process an HVCS instruction because of, for example, a problem\n\t\twith the content or the format of the instruction or an invalid account number."
            "If an instructed agent cannot process an HVCS instruction, rule 9.21 and clause 2.2 of these HVCS\n\t\tCommon Procedures, provides the instructed agent two options. The instructed agent can either return\n\t\tthe HVCS instruction to the instructing agent or the instructed agent can arrange to correct the HVCS\n\t\tinstruction."
            "The following diagram summarises the processes that apply if the HVCS instruction contains an error."
        ] meta {
            html::attributes = {
                class = "level1"
            }
        }
    ] meta {
        html::attributes = {
            class = "clause-row"
        }
    }
    div = {
        img = "" meta {
            html::attributes = {
                src = "images/hvcs_common_error_process.png"
                alt = "Error Process"
            }
        }
    } meta {
        html::attributes = {
            class = "diagram"
        }
    }
    div = "" meta {
        html::attributes = {
            class = "tag-standards"
        }
    }
    div = [
        div = "Error prevents processing" meta {
            html::attributes = {
                id = "2.2-error-prevents-processing"
                class = "clause-heading"
                data-number = "2.2"
            }
        }
        ol = [
            "This clause applies to an instructed agent who has received a settled HVCS payment but cannot process\n\t\tthe HVCS payment because of an error relating to the HVCS payment."
            "The instructed agent must do one of the following:"
            ol = [
                "return the HVCS payment to the instructing agent in accordance with the applicable HVCS standards:"
                "require the instructing agent to send data to amend the HVCS payment:"
                "amend the HVCS payment without asking the instructing agent for amended data and, as soon as\n\t\t\tpracticable after amendment is complete, process the HVCS payment."
            ] meta {
                html::attributes = {
                    class = "level2 level2-counter-reset"
                }
            }
            "For a cross border redirection (as described in clause 9.1(2)(a)(iii) of the Rules), the instructed agent\n\t\tmust not deduct any fees from the amount of the HVCS payment before returning it."
            "If an instructing agent of an HVCS payment receives a request from an instructed agent under subclause\n\t\t(2)(b), the instructing agent must, as soon as practicable after receiving the request, send data to amend\n\t\tthe HVCS payment to the instructed agent."
            "If the instructed agent receives amended data from an instructing agent under subclause (4), the\n\t\tinstructing agent must, as soon as practicable after receiving the data, use the data to amend the HVCS\n\t\tpayment."
        ] meta {
            html::attributes = {
                class = "level1 level1-counter-reset"
            }
        }
    ] meta {
        html::attributes = {
            class = "clause-row"
        }
    }
    div = "" meta {
        html::attributes = {
            class = "tag-bestpractice"
        }
    }
    div = [
        div = "Instructed agent credits wrong account" meta {
            html::attributes = {
                id = "2.3-instructed-agent-credits-wrong-account"
                class = "clause-heading"
                data-number = "2.3"
            }
        }
        ol = [
            "If the instructed agent of an HVCS payment credits the wrong account number with the amount of the HVCS\n\t\tpayment and the instructing agent incurs loss as a direct result of the error, the instructed agent must\n\t\tpay the instructing agent the amount of the loss up to the value of the HVCS payment if one of the\n\t\tfollowing applies:"
            ol = [
                "the payment message specified the correct account number:"
                "the instructing agent sent data to the instructed agent to amend the payment message in accordance\n\t\t\twith clause 2.2 of these HVCS Common Procedures and the data specified the correct account number:"
                "the instructed agent—"
                ol = [
                    "could not process the HVCS instruction because of an error relating to the HVCS instruction; and"
                    "did not obtain data from the instructing agent to amend the payment message under clause 2.2 of\n\t\t\t\tthese HVCS Common Procedures; and"
                    "amended the HVCS payment with the wrong account number."
                ] meta {
                    html::attributes = {
                        class = "level3 level3-counter-reset"
                    }
                }
            ] meta {
                html::attributes = {
                    class = "level2 level2-counter-reset"
                }
            }
            "If the instructed agent of an HVCS payment credits the wrong account number with the amount of the HVCS\n\t\tpayment because the instructing agent specified the wrong account number in the payment message the\n\t\tinstructing agent must, as soon as practicable after it becomes aware that the wrong account number has\n\t\tbeen credited—"
            ol = [
                "send the payment message to the instructed agent again; and"
                "ensure that the payment message contains the correct account number."
            ] meta {
                html::attributes = {
                    class = "level2 level2-counter-reset"
                }
            }
        ] meta {
            html::attributes = {
                class = "level1 level1-counter-reset"
            }
        }
    ] meta {
        html::attributes = {
            class = "clause-row"
        }
    }
    div = "" meta {
        html::attributes = {
            class = "tag-bestpractice"
        }
    }
    div = [
        div = "Co-operate to resolve processing errors" meta {
            html::attributes = {
                id = "2.4-co-operate-to-resolve-processing-errors"
                class = "clause-heading"
                data-number = "2.4"
            }
        }
        ol = [
            "Participants should co-operate to resolve a problem caused by a processing error affecting a HVCS\n\t\tinstruction."
            "For example, if an instructed agent credits the amount of a HVCS payment to the wrong creditor's\n\t\taccount number—"
            ol = [
                "the instructing agent may ask the instructed agent to freeze funds in the creditor's account\n\t\t\tuntil the problem is resolved; and"
                "the instructed agent should determine whether to comply with the request, including by having\n\t\t\tregard to whether the instructed agent has the legal right to do so."
            ] meta {
                html::attributes = {
                    class = "level2 level2-counter-reset"
                }
            }
        ] meta {
            html::attributes = {
                class = "level1 level1-counter-reset"
            }
        }
    ] meta {
        html::attributes = {
            class = "clause-row"
        }
    }
    div = "" meta {
        html::attributes = {
            class = "tag-commentary"
        }
    }
    div = [
        div = "Request and response formats" meta {
            html::attributes = {
                id = "2.5-request-and-response-formats"
                class = "clause-heading"
                data-number = "2.5"
            }
        }
        div = [
            div = [
                div = [
                    span = "UG2025" meta {
                        html::attributes = {
                            class = "doc-comment-id"
                        }
                    }
                    span = "JW" meta {
                        html::attributes = {
                            class = "doc-comment-initials"
                        }
                    }
                ] meta {
                    html::attributes = {
                        class = "doc-comment-meta"
                    }
                }
                div = [
                    "No change, though noting reference to MTn95 and MTn96."
                ] meta {
                    html::attributes = {
                        class = "doc-comment-content"
                    }
                }
            ] meta {
                html::attributes = {
                    class = "doc-comment"
                    data-change-id = "UG2025"
                }
            }
            "If an instructed agent asks an instructing agent under rule 9.21 and clause 2.2 of these HVCS Common\n\t\tProcedures, to send data to correct an HVCS instruction, the instructed agent can request the data by,\n\t\tfor example, phone or using SWIFT message MTn95-Queries.  If the instructing agent of a payment message\n\t\tsends corrected data to the instructed agent under rule 9.21 and clause 2.2 of these HVCS Common\n\t\tProcedures, the instructing agent can use, for example, SWIFT message MTn96-Answers."
        ] meta {
            html::attributes = {
                class = "level1"
            }
        }
    ] meta {
        html::attributes = {
            class = "clause-row"
        }
    }
    h1 = "Chapter 3: Late processing" meta {
        html::attributes = {
            id = "chapter-3-late-processing"
            class = "section-heading"
        }
    }
    div = "" meta {
        html::attributes = {
            class = "tag-commentary"
        }
    }
    div = [
        div = "Late processing" meta {
            html::attributes = {
                id = "3.1-late-processing"
                class = "clause-heading"
                data-number = "3.1"
            }
        }
        div = [
            "Rule 9.11 and clause 1.4 of these HVCS Common Procedures requires an instructing agent to send an HVCS\n\t\tinstruction no later than 16:45 on a business day unless standards 3.3 or 3.4 apply."
            "The following diagram gives an overview of the processes that apply if the instructing agent proposes\n\t\tto send an HVCS instruction after 16:45. The diagram has no legal effect."
        ] meta {
            html::attributes = {
                class = "level1"
            }
        }
    ] meta {
        html::attributes = {
            class = "clause-row"
        }
    }
    div = {
        img = "" meta {
            html::attributes = {
                src = "images/hvcs_common_late_processing.png"
                alt = "Late Processing"
            }
        }
    } meta {
        html::attributes = {
            class = "diagram"
        }
    }
    div = "" meta {
        html::attributes = {
            class = "tag-standards"
        }
    }
    div = [
        div = "When HVCS payments settle" meta {
            html::attributes = {
                id = "3.2-when-hvcs-payments-settle"
                class = "clause-heading"
                data-number = "3.2"
            }
        }
        ol = [
            "The effect of rule 9.14 is that if the instructing agent settles an HVCS payment after 17:15, unless\n\t\tthe late HVCS instruction requirements apply, the instructed agent:"
            ol = [
                "is not required to process the HVCS instruction that business day, but"
                "may decide to process the HVCS instruction that business day to meet the requirements or the\n\t\t\texpectations of its customer."
            ] meta {
                html::attributes = {
                    class = "level2 level2-counter-reset"
                }
            }
        ] meta {
            html::attributes = {
                class = "level1 level1-counter-reset"
            }
        }
    ] meta {
        html::attributes = {
            class = "clause-row"
        }
    }
    div = "" meta {
        html::attributes = {
            class = "tag-standards"
        }
    }
    div = [
        div = "Sending customer HVCS instructions after 16:45" meta {
            html::attributes = {
                id = "3.3-sending-customer-hvcs-instructions-after-1645"
                class = "clause-heading"
                data-number = "3.3"
            }
        }
        ol = [
            "This clause applies to a customer credit transfer message that is an SCP or a cross border payment\n\t\tredirection if—"
            ol = [
                "a technical problem or an operational problem prevents the instructing agent from sending the\n\t\t\tcustomer credit transfer message by 16.45 on a business day; and"
                "the instructing agent requires the instructed agent to credit the creditor's account with the\n\t\t\tamount of an HVCS payment that business day."
            ] meta {
                html::attributes = {
                    class = "level2 level2-counter-reset"
                }
            }
            "The instructing agent—"
            ol = [
                "must obtain the instructed agent's explicit consent to the time by which the instructing agent\n\t\t\tmust send a HVCS instruction to which this standard applies; and"
                "must use the contact people and method of communicating for the instructed agent specified in the\n\t\t\tindustry incident contact list; and"
                "is entitled to obtain the consent in written form or verbal form."
            ] meta {
                html::attributes = {
                    class = "level2 level2-counter-reset"
                }
            }
            "The instructed agent is not required to consent to a request from an instructing agent to send a\n\t\tcustomer credit transfer message after 16:45. For example, the instructed agent may not be able to\n\t\tprocess the HVCS instruction at the time requested."
            "If the instructing agent obtains the instructed agent's consent to a time for sending the HVCS\n\t\tinstruction and the instructing agent sends the HVCS instruction by the agreed time, the timeframe\n\t\tin clause 1.4 of these HVCS Common Procedures does not apply to the HVCS instruction."
        ] meta {
            html::attributes = {
                class = "level1 level1-counter-reset"
            }
        }
    ] meta {
        html::attributes = {
            class = "clause-row"
        }
    }
    div = [
        div = "Sending FI HVCS instructions after 16:45" meta {
            html::attributes = {
                id = "3.4-sending-fi-hvcs-instructions-after-1645"
                class = "clause-heading"
                data-number = "3.4"
            }
        }
        ol = [
            "This clause applies to a participant who proposes to send and receive FI credit transfer messages\n\t\tduring the CLS evening session either—"
            ol = [
                "as the creditor or the debtor; or"
                "on behalf of a FI customer."
            ] meta {
                html::attributes = {
                    class = "level2 level2-counter-reset"
                }
            }
            "The participant may only send and receive FI credit transfer messages during the CLS evening session\n\t\ton a business day if—"
            ol = [
                "no less than 1 month before that business day,—"
                ol = [
                    "the participant has notified the chief executive of Payments NZ that on and from a specified\n\t\t\t\tdate the participant proposes to send and receive FI credit transfer messages during the CLS\n\t\t\t\tevening session; and"
                    "the chief executive has notified every other participant that on and from the specified date\n\t\t\t\tthe participant proposes to send and receive FI credit transfer messages during the CLS evening\n\t\t\t\tsession; and"
                ] meta {
                    html::attributes = {
                        class = "level3 level3-counter-reset"
                    }
                }
                "the participant has, on and from the date specified in the chief executive's notification,\n\t\t\tparticipated in every CLS evening session; and"
                "the participant participates in the CLS evening session that business day during the time period\n\t\t\tcommencing at 16:45 on the business day and ending 30 minutes after the final CLS pay out."
            ] meta {
                html::attributes = {
                    class = "level2 level2-counter-reset"
                }
            }
            "If the participant sends an FI credit transfer message during the CLS evening session in accordance\n\t\twith subclause (2), the timeframe in clause 1.4 of these HVCS Common Procedures do not apply to the\n\t\tFI credit transfer messages."
            "If a participant proposes to cease sending and receiving FI credit transfer messages during the CLS\n\t\tevening session, no less than 1 month before the business day that the participant proposes to cease\n\t\tsending and receiving the FI credit transfer messages, the participant must notify Payments NZ that\n\t\tit proposes to cease."
        ] meta {
            html::attributes = {
                class = "level1 level1-counter-reset"
            }
        }
    ] meta {
        html::attributes = {
            class = "clause-row"
        }
    }
    div = "" meta {
        html::attributes = {
            class = "tag-commentary"
        }
    }
    div = [
        div = "Evening session participants" meta {
            html::attributes = {
                id = "3.5-evening-session-participants"
                class = "clause-heading"
                data-number = "3.5"
            }
        }
        div = [
            "Participants who send and receive financial institution credit transfers during the CLS evening\n\t\tsession are:"
            div = [
                div = [
                    span = "UG2025" meta {
                        html::attributes = {
                            class = "doc-comment-id"
                        }
                    }
                    span = "RK" meta {
                        html::attributes = {
                            class = "doc-comment-initials"
                        }
                    }
                ] meta {
